   "text": "What a manager is. Before, your job was your own work. Now it is your team’s work, and the people who do it. Three things are new. You decide what matters this week. You approve timecards, time off, and expenses, so look before you sign. And you are responsible for people: fair treatment, a safe place to speak up, a chance to grow. You do not have to know everything. You do have to show up as the manager."
