   "text": "Job one: get the work done. When people are not sure what is expected, work comes in late or quietly drops. Four habits fix that. Plan it: three priorities, each with an owner. Say it: what each person owns, by when, and what good looks like, in writing. Check it: look at work while it is in progress, not on the due date. Fix it: when something breaks twice, find the cause. This week, confirm with one person what they own and by when."
