   "text": "Job two: take care of your people. People stay, and do their best work, for a manager who notices them. Four habits. Listen and help: move what you can, and send anything that sounds like leave to the leave office the same day. Grow them: one assignment a quarter that stretches. Thank them: specific, by name, that week. Trust them: hand over the decision, not just the task. This week, thank one person for one specific thing."
