   "text": "Job three: make things better. Vanderbilt is asking every team to move faster and improve, and that happens in your team, in small ways, every week. Four habits. Explain the why, in your own words, before the announcement. Describe where the team is going, in two sentences. Let people try: two weeks, then show me. Look back: ten minutes after big work, what worked and what changes. This week, hold one ten-minute look-back."
